        "4957 - وَ قَالَ عَلِيٌّ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : \"مَنْ مَشَى إِلَى صَاحِبِ بِدْعَةٍ فَوَقَّرَهُ فَقَدْ سَعَى فِي هَدْمِ اَلْإِسْلاَمِ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4957 - Imam Ali ibn Abi Talib (as) said:\n\"Whoever walks towards a person of innovation and shows him respect has indeed contributed to the destruction of Islam.\""
        ]
      }
